/ingos\">Ingos</a></td></tr></table><h2>Verbundene Orte</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Karten</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz23k\">Karansuls Herrschaftsgebiet</a></td></tr></table><h2>Bewohner</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Verwandte Seite</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/grey\">Graues Blatt</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/haburu\">Khabburu</a></td></tr></table><h2>Kreaturen und Personen</h2><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>Verwandte Seite</th><th>Einzelheiten</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/hare\">Hase</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz23k%20driad%20leader%20m\">Kreatur (Variante 135)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz23k%20driad%20green%20archer1\">Kreatur (Variante 136)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz23k%20driad%20green%20mage1\">Kreatur (Variante 137)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz23k%20unicorn%20white\">Kreatur (Variante 138)</a></td><td /></tr></table></article>","id":"","image":"5f73121b37cfbbcc4f28f849","image_caption":"Originaler Schauplatz","image_kind":"scene","pins":[],"representative_image":false,"title":"Neue Heimat des Grünen Clans"}]}
